bs 17:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.2\">17:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.20\">19:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.7\">22:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 19:14\" href=\"/Psalms.19.14\">ψ 19:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:21\" href=\"/Psalms.105.21\">105:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:41\" href=\"/Psalms.106.41\">106:41</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:43\" href=\"/Daniel.11.43\">Dn 11:43</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 9:17\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.9.17\">Ec 9:17</a>; rarely other preps.: ל (c. inf.) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:8\" href=\"/Exodus.21.8\">Ex 21:8</a> (E); <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל־</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.15\">Pr 28:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:37\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.37\">Ne 9:37</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל־</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 33:26\" href=\"/Jeremiah.33.26\">Je 33:26</a>; c. sf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 52:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.52.5\">Is 52:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 30:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.30.21\">Je 30:21</a>; c. acc. cogn. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ מִמְשָׁל רָ֑ב</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:3\" href=\"/Daniel.11.3\">Dn 11:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:4\" href=\"/Daniel.11.4\">4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מָשַׁל מִן</span> … <span dir=\"rtl\">וְעַד</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 12:2\" href=\"/Joshua.12.2\">Jos 12:2</a> (D); abs. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.3\">2 S 23:3</a> (cf. Dr), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.14\">Ez 19:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 6:13\" href=\"/Zechariah.6.13\">Zc 6:13</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> loc.), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.24\">Pr 12:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.2\">29:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:5\" href=\"/Daniel.11.5\">Dn 11:5</a>; especially Pt. as subst. = <em>ruler</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">משֵׁל־אֶרֶץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.1\">Is 16:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">משֵׁל עַמִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:20\" href